1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Login screen: a new login creates an
account, and passwords are stored hashed.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Character selection lists the account's
characters, with search and paging.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:29,980
Character creation: choose gender, skin
color, hair, eyes, mouth and head shape.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:45,980
All new characters start as Novices, who
later advance to a first class.

5
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Naming the character and pressing Create
adds it to the account.

6
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,980
Selecting the character and pressing Start
loads the world with its saved data.

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,980
Movement is click-to-move for now. WASD
and gamepad support are planned.

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Combat uses auto-attack on a selected
target, with floating damage numbers.

9
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:29,980
Status window: the six base stats (STR,
AGI, VIT, INT, DEX, LUK).

10
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:44,980
Stats drive derived values such as attack,
accuracy and max HP and SP.

11
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:53,980
Leveling up Base Level grants stat points
to distribute.

12
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,480
Sped up.

13
00:01:55,500 --> 00:02:05,480
Job Level is a separate progression. Each
Job Level grants a skill point.

14
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:15,480
Skills are learned in the Skill Book and
dragged to the Skill Hotbar.

15
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:25,480
Novice skills are self buffs and heals.
The hotbar uses number keys 1 to 0.

16
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:29,747
Sped up.

17
00:02:29,767 --> 00:02:39,747
Using a skill spends mana (SP) and starts
its cooldown, shown on the hotbar icon.

18
00:02:39,767 --> 00:02:43,513
Sped up.

19
00:02:43,533 --> 00:02:49,533
Warp portals connect the maps. This one
leads to the city.

20
00:02:50,533 --> 00:02:58,513
NPCs offer dialogue and services.

21
00:02:58,533 --> 00:03:06,513
The shop window lets the player buy items
with Zeny.

22
00:03:06,533 --> 00:03:09,013
Sped up.

23
00:03:09,033 --> 00:03:14,033
Different environments will have different
NPCs with different functions.

24
00:03:15,033 --> 00:03:21,283
Sped up.

25
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:35,280
Defeated enemies drop loot from their loot
tables.

26
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:42,300
Items go to the inventory, which has
weight-based capacity and tooltips.

27
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:48,550
Sped up.

28
00:03:49,567 --> 00:04:02,547
Selling items to the shop NPC converts
them into Zeny.

29
00:04:02,567 --> 00:04:16,567
The Zeny counter on the HUD increases with
each sale.

30
00:04:26,567 --> 00:04:36,567
World Map window: an overview of the
game's maps.

31
00:04:39,567 --> 00:04:47,547
The quest log lists the character's active
quests.

32
00:04:47,567 --> 00:04:57,547
Quest board: NPCs post quests that the
player can accept.

33
00:04:57,567 --> 00:05:07,567
Accepted quests are added to the log with
their objectives.

34
00:05:10,567 --> 00:05:25,547
Leaving to Character Selection and
pressing Start resumes at the same place.

35
00:05:25,567 --> 00:05:34,447
Exiting the game also saves progress
automatically.

36
00:05:34,467 --> 00:05:44,467
For this part, imagine the previous
character has already gained many levels.

37
00:05:45,467 --> 00:05:58,447
Equipment has nine slots, and each item
adds stat bonuses that update live.

38
00:05:58,467 --> 00:06:11,467
Equipping gear makes the character
stronger, raising STR and attack.

39
00:06:12,467 --> 00:06:21,447
Reaching Job Level 10 lets a Novice
advance to a first class, here Swordman.

40
00:06:21,467 --> 00:06:29,467
Advancing resets Base and Job Level, but
the allocated stats are kept.

41
00:06:30,467 --> 00:06:43,447
The new class unlocks exclusive skills,
such as Bash and Magnum Break.

42
00:06:43,467 --> 00:06:59,217
Sped up.

43
00:07:00,233 --> 00:07:17,233
This progression lets the player explore
new areas and face stronger enemies.
